1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:07,000
Assalamu alaikum. Register for HBIC Quran Academy
on the website or in the HBIC app.

2
00:00:07,000 --> 00:00:15,000
Visit hbic.ca/quran-academy.
Sign in, or create and verify a parent account.

3
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:21,000
Enter your details and add your child.

4
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:27,000
Choose Qaida, Quran, or Not sure.
Add another child if needed.

5
00:00:27,000 --> 00:00:34,000
Choose WhatsApp updates, and enable app alerts
after registering if you wish.

6
00:00:34,000 --> 00:00:41,000
Tuition is $50 per child each month
and is required to participate.

7
00:00:41,000 --> 00:00:47,000
Pay by card through secure Stripe Checkout,
or choose cash at HBIC.

8
00:00:47,000 --> 00:00:57,000
Registration appears as conditional.
Cash remains due until staff receive it.

9
00:00:57,000 --> 00:01:04,000
Show your Academy pass to staff at the masjid.
They check the live payment status.

10
00:01:04,000 --> 00:01:12,000
For cash, staff record payment first,
then confirm enrollment and class check-in.

11
00:01:12,000 --> 00:01:20,000
The same steps are in the HBIC app.
Join the Academy WhatsApp group for updates.

12
00:01:20,000 --> 00:01:25,000
hbic.ca/quran-academy
JazakumAllahu khairan.
